  "body": "<!-- workflow-source:local_request -->\n## Summary\nRepair the reproduced dev-tool final independent-verification binding mismatch without weakening exact-head or reviewer authority. Closes #3849. Background campaign #1836 is coordination only; no hosted writer is requested.\n\n## Tasks\n- [x] Share one lane-aware immutable-record guard across the REST and final GraphQL checkpoints.\n- [x] Retain complete-record equality, live lease, exact full PR head and branch checks; require observed heads for stable workflow deliveries and reject conflicting optional dev-tool observations.\n- [x] Cover the actual controller closure with deliberate pre-fix RED/fixed GREEN and race controls.\n- [x] Document the source-owned record contract and source-only ownership.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Valid Maint52 dev-tool records without invented head-observation fields can pass final finding disposition; workflow deliveries still need their observed-head binding.\n- [x] Changed full head/branch/plan/source/generation/tree/repository/durable issue/lease, expired or malformed leases, invalid branches, conflicting observations, withdrawn/deleted attestations and incomplete review evidence remain fail-closed.\n- [x] Three focused Node files pass: 66 tests, zero failures. Original source replay fails the actual dev-tool controller success case with verification_changed_before_resolution, and exposes formerly unchecked final tree/repository changes. Branch-rename regression is RED on both lanes before correction and GREEN afterward.\n- [x] No generated consumer branch/thread is changed, no workflow is added, and no new consumer-managed file is introduced.\n\n## Validation\n`node --test .github/scripts/__tests__/maint71_devtool_final_binding.test.js .github/scripts/__tests__/maint71_finding_verification.test.js .github/scripts/__tests__/maint71_merge_sync_prs.test.js`: 66 PASS, zero failures/skips. Expanded maint71*, sync_pr_lease_contract and sync_pr_merge_contract suite: 174 PASS, zero failures/skips. Deliberate baseline overlay reads production source from 19ab61a1e281791e915e512407fffa20515600bb without checkout/file mutation; actual controller replay RED exit 1, fixed suite GREEN exit 0. Adopted originating-reviewer branch-rename finding: collect and validate current headRefName on both GraphQL reads and every pagination snapshot; two real controller branch-rename cases plus incomplete/paginated collector controls deliberately fail before this fix. Raw execution logs are published in PR comments and retained locally. `git diff --check` passes.\n\n## Ownership\nLocally owned Sol repair under campaign permit 12f15449-d202-4a60-a226-a79ed556a6cd (expires 2026-10-12T00:48:20Z). No concrete agent routing label/keepalive opt-in. Maint71 helper and ops docs are source-only, absent from sync-manifest; no template or manifest change is appropriate.\n\n## Campaign follow-through (outside implementation checklist)\nAfter source review, complete CI, seven-minute unchanged-head floor and merge, replay the already-published exact-head independent proof through serialized Maint71. CodeRabbit's separate thread remains independently gated. This PR does not claim consumer disposition, delivery merge, whole-fleet completion or provider acceptance.\n\n<!-- pr-preamble:start -->\n<!-- meta:issue:3849 -->\n> **Source:** Issue #3849\n\nCloses #3849\n\n<!-- pr-preamble:end -->\n\n<!-- auto-status-summary:start -->\n## Automated Status Summary\n#### Scope\n_Scope section missing from source issue._\n\n<!-- Updated WORKFLOW_OUTPUTS.md context:start -->\n## Context for Agent\n\n### Related Issues/PRs\n- [stranske/Workflows#1836](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/issues/1836)\n- [stranske/Trend_Model_Project#6079](https://github.com/stranske/Trend_Model_Project/issues/6079)\n- [#1836](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/issues/1836)\n<!-- Updated WORKFLOW_OUTPUTS.md context:end -->\n\n#### Tasks\n- [ ] Reproduce the valid exact-head dev-tool record counterexample using the actual schema and final controller path, with deliberate RED.\n- [ ] Implement one lane-aware final binding contract: keep workflow-delivery observed-head requirements; validate dev-tool exact current PR head plus immutable record/source/tree/lease bindings. Do not merely remove the check or accept a conflicting observed head.\n- [ ] Exercise both initial and immediately-pre-mutation reads. Negative controls: changed head, source/plan/generation/tree/lease, expired lease, conflicting observed head, missing required workflow binding, altered attestation or reviewer activity, and incomplete review pagination. Preserve strict concurrency and reviewer authority.\n- [ ] Update defining ops docs and relevant tests; check source/template/manifest ownership rather than adding generated-consumer edits.\n- [ ] Obtain source review, complete CI, seven-minute unchanged-head floor and merge before replaying the existing proof through serialized Maint 71. Preserve the separate CodeRabbit thread and all ordinary merge gates.\n\n#### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Campaign: Workflows #1836. Consumer: stranske/Trend_Model_Project#6079, exact head `39ab28414db3944adcb74f73daee66806921edfc`.\n- [ ] Maint 52 generation run: https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38185912450 . Delivery plan `dev-tool-ab725abacde7`, generation `ab725abacde7`, source `19ab61a1e281791e915e512407fffa20515600bb`, desired tree `79080970d514c98122ec25fae6fd41933c587b5f`, lease `2026-10-14T23:53:24Z`.\n- [ ] Completed independent Sol finding assessment `22d43c3d255ce9a8b2defe2e4342195d546d24f53ac42f1bdd07a128050b99e2`, result SHA256 `f45bb38eb7380f8c9b3f51c3b43d529939ec782460be577e235124d1c0df91ed`, exact-head bounded classification PASS. Durable attestation: https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/issues/1836#issuecomment-6115389680 . This is not whole-PR or originating-bot acceptance.\n- [ ] Actual resolution run https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38186594757 completed with `review_resolution_thread_ids: []`, error `PRRT_kwDOO0LrSc6rRwzT:verification_changed_before_resolution`, and two active threads. Its immutable `sync-pr-merge-report.json` is authoritative, not workflow success.\n- [ ] Source `.github/scripts/maint71_merge_sync_prs.js` final independent-verification condition at `latestRecord?.head_observed_sha !== pr.head.sha` rejects the missing field. The request-stage validator already distinguishes dev-tool deliveries and optional observed-head binding. Source main `19ab61a1e281791e915e512407fffa20515600bb` was executing.\n\n**Head SHA:** e0779157e05d86076a92ac631ebd6a768bdd3fa0\n**Latest Runs:** \u2705 success \u2014 Gate\n**Required:** gate: \u2705 success\n\n| Workflow / Job | Result | Logs |\n|----------------|--------|------|\n| Gate | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519261) |\n| Health 40 Sweep | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519562) |\n| Health 44 Gate Branch Protection | \u23f3 pending | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519250) |\n| Health 45 Agents Guard | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519220) |\n| Health 50 Security Scan | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519209) |\n| Health 52 Semgrep Scan | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519236) |\n| Health 72 Template Sync | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519245) |\n| Maint 52 Validate Workflows | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519154) |\n| PR 11 - Minimal invariant CI | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519313) |\n| PR 46 Dependency Repair Contract | \u23ed\ufe0f skipped | Last completed result; current run in PR checks |\n| Selftest CI | \u2754 in progress | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519293) |\n| Validate Sync Manifest | \u2705 success | [View run](https://github.com/stranske/Workflows/actions/runs/38187519206) |\n<!-- auto-status-summary:end -->",
